# Balance Files — Cursor Rules

These files contain only plain Dart constants. When editing them:

- Only change the **values**, not the structure
- Do not add methods, conditionals, or imports
- Every constant has a comment — update it if the meaning changes
- After editing, run `flutter test` to verify nothing broke
- Document the before/after values in your commit message

See `GAME_BALANCE.md` for the rationale behind every value.
